            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "Set out on an adventure that challenges all the codes of the RPG genre, toying with its boundaries to create something unlike anything you've ever seen.<br />\r\nIn a world full of magic and adventure, a young boy starts his apprenticeship to become a knight, protector of the Kingdom.<br />\r\nHe will face many challenges along the way, but overcoming them will allow him to grow into the hero the world needs.<br />\r\nJoin him in his quest to find himself, as his steps guide him towards something way bigger than him: the mystery surrounding the very nature of mankind and the fabric of reality itself.<br />\r\nIf you can get past the admittedly quirky open source game engine, you're in for a life changing experience.",
